# SHA-256 digest of the certificate that signs every release of this fork
# (CN=lazzurs phonetrack-android fork). scripts/release/verify-apk-signer.sh compares each built
# APK with it. Check it yourself on a downloaded APK: apksigner verify --print-certs phonetrack-X.Y.Z-normal.apk
# Never change it: Android only installs an update signed with the same key (see RELEASING.md).
